, or intuition by rolling dice in true tabletop RPG style! Do what you feel is right \u2014 or don't. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/2a2b63ac057c97650cca4391daf0dde6.poster.avif?t=1759137746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/2a2b63ac057c97650cca4391daf0dde6.webm?t=1759137746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/2a2b63ac057c97650cca4391daf0dde6.mp4?t=1759137746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/44ff155a5b43ed703db3e1700e531b24.avif?t=1759137746\" width=616 height=273 /></span><strong>Shape your character with a unique blend of skills</strong> that encompass not only physical and mental attributes but also the ability to channel the spirit world. Whether you follow your morals or give in to instincts will shape how you see the world\u2014and how it sees you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/6e7039370dc3447a4cc2b80256a54e9e.poster.avif?t=1759137746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/6e7039370dc3447a4cc2b80256a54e9e.webm?t=1759137746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780990/extras/6e7039370dc3447a4cc2b80256a54e9e.mp4?t=1759137746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><